{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given a string `s`, split it into pieces so that **every piece is a palindrome**. Return all the possible splits."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/45dac4d5-35d5-4332-9f9f-597e1541c7b8.svg",
      "alt": "Partitions of aab. The first piece can be a, aa or aab; aab isn't a palindrome, so that branch is cut. After a, the next piece can be a or ab; ab isn't a palindrome. Two complete splits remain: a, a, b and aa, b.",
